        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles text-pink-400"></i></div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide">Friendly UI & UX</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Navigating is as smooth as a scroll through the landscapes in <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">Spirited Away</span>. Find titles easily with an enjoyable experience.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-door-open text-yellow-400"></i></div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide">No Sign-Up</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Like flying on <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">Kiki's</span> broomstick, dive straight into anime without registration hurdles. We value your freedom!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-tv text-green-400"></i></div>
